# .NET build output (nested patterns need the ** prefix — a bare "bin/" only matches at the
# context root, not per-project folders, and stale local obj/ output bakes host-specific NuGet
# paths into project.assets.json that break restore/publish inside the container).
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/artifacts/
**/TestResults/
**/*.user

# Aspire / IDE
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/

# Node / Angular
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/.angular/

# VCS / tooling
.git/
.github/
.claude/
skarbiec-plan/
